{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Battlegrounds is a shoot 'em up survival game set in a kid\u2019s bedroom. Battle endless waves of toys using a variety of weapons in atmospheric nighttime surroundings. Survive against different enemy types, collect power-ups, and prove your skills in this action-packed toy war!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/17a6053dc31559ac4c7c047bc83bfdd3.poster.avif?t=1772360804\" width=604 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/17a6053dc31559ac4c7c047bc83bfdd3.webm?t=1772360804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/17a6053dc31559ac4c7c047bc83bfdd3.mp4?t=1772360804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Toy Battlegrounds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toy Battlegrounds is a shoot 'em up survival  game set in the vibrant and chaotic world of a kid\u2019s bedroom. Transformed to toy size, you must survive relentless waves of animated toys that come to life in the dead of night. Use a variety of weapons, each with unique firepower, and unlock power-ups to enhance your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/5e0a8075acadf627658d7919b34c364e.poster.avif?t=1772360804\" width=600 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/5e0a8075acadf627658d7919b34c364e.webm?t=1772360804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/5e0a8075acadf627658d7919b34c364e.mp4?t=1772360804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against different enemy types, from swarming toy soldiers to hulking bosses, all while navigating around the room\u2019s obstacles. With an atmospheric nighttime setting, intense gameplay, and non-stop action, Toy Battlegrounds challenges you to hold your ground and become the ultimate toy hero!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3261890?t=1772360804","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3261890?t=1772360804","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/fb2216e91ac125e0316f977c7e5e5844c0151cf6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772360804","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/fb2216e91ac125e0316f977c7e5e5844c0151cf6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772360804","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>New Shoot 'em up Survival!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3261890/extras/c5c198bef0144e64e0eb69566596367d.avif?t=1772360804\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Toy Battlegrounds is a shoot 'em up survival game set in a kid\u2019s bedroom. Battle endless waves of toys using a variety of weapons in atmospheric nighttime surroundings. Survive against different enemy types, collect power-ups, and prove your skills in this action-packed toy war!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s